{"contract":"translation_surface_screen_v1","entries":[{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"bb58828f0de2f435e26e35e0f6167a77baa31887c51c1240c9822644332bc649","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"83cd3fbc45d9d6b5faeb39fec8a04b56f70d12c4e9f6da4d07e87268ac1798c5","logical_entry_identity":"ae4a5fe3f8269aaabe390bf076f61613e7884a9f6e71dc91d80b4b1e9c36a756","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"alchemist sapphire","source_tag":"alchemist gem","target":"炼金青玉"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"69dd669447f624ae935d2fe9d82f95237d2afd022aeedcc24e65e51941b16064","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"83d0176cf881fdbca0106bfd06734965bae13d7b35a8266f71ee10c9f36f1853","logical_entry_identity":"9a82a3c933a5d4c9230353863d43b2770aea2565dc9c9d9cc200449ae75798b5","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Give order to character 5","source_tag":"_t","target":"发布指令：角色5"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"b66850c58f1c187a24a22979623d83c37fe92473dfaac0e9d998c32d0fab6f7b","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"83d6e82596c0beaff0e7679343d35c61aa28e0d4f11f891eb3d2bf6fd7c8d14f","logical_entry_identity":"92b4221b7390e6f9dcbf54b695013302280447b1aeecd53205ee372b4bf6e0e9","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Gravitational Staff","source_tag":"entity name","target":"重力之杖"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"db2eec5300d5ae5a4ff16a0f534ba6d9f0d9a0bf2bf9dc2483feb90c3209051e","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"83dc5ce8f2a08d5fd6344cedb923f87cb4414ca041ead7b257c4f9fb6d928c46","logical_entry_identity":"438953a52b455c2f895e8eb2eacd6b4bd6e0bf2fe9d37746cfa697a043f7f206","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Welcome #LIGHT_GREEN#@name@#WHITE#.\nYou are a native of the northern region of the Allied Kingdoms, a peaceful land that both Humans and Halflings call home. You hail from the small town called Derth.\nHumans are the most common race of the land, and you are one of them. In an attempt to prove your worth, you have decided to venture into the old and wild places of the world, looking for ancient treasures and glory.\n\nYou have come to a land called the Derthfields on the western border of the Thaloren forest, in search of the Trollmire. It is an old forest infested with trolls and all kinds of wild animals.\nTo the west lies another dangerous place: the old ruins of Kor'Pul. You heard the caves below it were infested by vermin and undead.\n\nAfter days of travel, you have found the forest and entered it. What will you find there...?\n","source_tag":"_t","target":"欢迎你 #LIGHT_GREEN#@name@#WHITE#！\n你是联合王国北部地区的一个居民，那里是人类和半身人平静的家园。\n你来自于一个叫做德斯的小镇。\n人类是这片土地上最主要的种族，而你就是其中的一员。为了证明你的价值，你决定到野外那些古老的地方去冒险，寻找财富和荣耀。\n\n你来到了自然精灵森林西部边界附近一个叫做德斯荒野的地方，\n寻找巨魔沼泽。这是一个被巨魔和野生动物占据的古老树林。\n向西走还有另一个危险的区域：卡·普尔废墟。你听说那里的地下盘踞着大量的害虫和亡灵生物。\n\n经过了几天的旅行，你终于发现并进入了这片树林，你会在那里发现什么呢……\n"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"56110f43914eb38b0ad5ff3454603d6ab52cdfee577db731d6014e6276893f2d","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"83df3d6f89fd36eec0ce9ed9f57cb4d96001cfd036ef8d7932e871e568b55569","logical_entry_identity":"da2abfc68abd4a90ad0c6c4bfff29fb495b7a2dd81d42f4bf34d3f40047e7c41","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"N.Energy each turn: ","source_tag":"_t","target":"每回合负能量值回复："},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"006f80ba5e364b5f6c026bcb8e826bad6df357149276311f4e63c72aeaf8028c","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"83e92602f33252d9a38dd82c62272f38c96753842f9fb422860fa605d5740985","logical_entry_identity":"b90dcb19876ad817f5852d773796216555ff5a19683399a2f5b5f3a1918bbb0a","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#GOLD#Well done! You have won the Arena: Challenge of the Master#WHITE#","source_tag":"_t","target":"#GOLD#干得好！你赢得了竞技场：领主的挑战#WHITE#"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"ab9a6d82a11afe70be68a9ae615f928a62dd9c03c1af47496a5c076850f6c752","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"83f2c45482931285ff9e48baafedd8fe638855c0dbc3533937b9514c169e8b16","logical_entry_identity":"d860cb001c0f0c7ed79116d2609aa271029a4aeddb327977128b4d10