ATE#Having failed to gain admittance to the Brotherhood of the Alchemists, %s no longer needs your help making the %s.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"#SLATE#无法获得炼金术士兄弟会的承认，%s不再需要你帮忙制作 %s。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"62990cf5322090b6a0244c1548b1503115f7c1d73184c5fe0114630504c828e7","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"840f66fee2a06eb0799248cf3bbc27de1d141f4475018fa5ec12c4e1a5c6c72f","logical_entry_identity":"e53000e778571147a31bff3cc89688b13c05512fcfe8403d2d02f06865b3936a","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#LIGHT_BLUE# Reset Randboss Data","source_tag":"log","target":"#LIGHT_BLUE# 重置Boss数据"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"f99ac6aebb53643574e740f381d66e553fe1d2189808bd12dc057bb1daa34090","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"8417d43c2563850dfb742299a97b8db6a0c04b06c85171d7b35c068bd856ce8c","logical_entry_identity":"a8546cde9052b5f096433849f97077b084fb2803f6d1ca20f211ea4b0779631b","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Allow various events that are pushed by the server when playing online\n#{bold}#All#{normal}#: Allow all server events (bonus zones, random events, ...)\n#{bold}#Technical help only#{normal}#: Allow administrator to help in case of bugs or weirdness and allows website services (data reset, steam achievements push, ...) to work.\n#{bold}#Disabled#{normal}#: Disallow all.\n#WHITE#","source_tag":"_t","target":"在线游戏的时候，允许服务器向你推送各种事件\n#{bold}#全部#{normal}#：允许各种服务器事件（活动地图，随机事件，…）\n#{bold}#仅技术支持#{normal}#：允许管理员来解决你的游戏Bug和问题，并且允许网站服务（数据重置，Steam成就推送等）发挥作用。\n#{bold}#禁用#{normal}#：全部不允许。\n#WHITE#"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"cb5eb07725bf60c1ee10675d08e1798d41d69d1938cfefef0d08d72b0fd94c28","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"841cd636c53ecd54d801cafcb0ccf4ff60ebbe2ac315b846f7e2322aeff441ec","logical_entry_identity":"f38a8c7e408d2ce3b50c73470e060d06e8e1a83a387400f43aab901c50c5a35e","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"-Dominated","source_tag":"_t","target":"-支配意志"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"e3bd1d2a8a6638a99039d0ba1203f7340bff4245728749338b91e7088e1ecc0b","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"841ea786287e5fddf4c765d3122dcaac357c415e164df8cc74239d695680c845","logical_entry_identity":"2751113b9952f6e1d8c1dd33c822583f52d2c267d540778fa171f8885bf050b6","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#LIGHT_GREEN#Quest '%s' completed!#WHITE#(Press 'j' to see the quest log)","source_tag":"logPlayer","target":"#LIGHT_GREEN#任务“%s”完成！#WHITE#（按 J 键查看任务日志）"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"bd7fcb12ec4340ce2e0dc99f2317ecfc73bbac82d28ca23ca13d710f54677dce","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"841eb9fc9105bb92d41cbee320b263990fa4c6a3bd069e789ec6164859841f62","logical_entry_identity":"131db50dc2476942dc2bb660d14b3c1657116ccf7f3c671ca5366aef21d1994b","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"A portal opens behind Ukllmswwik.","source_tag":"logPlayer","target":"乌克勒姆斯维奇身后开启了一道传送门。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"c35172ed42c0e0939453a43743e8e5351b45e681203b42378bbaaebfad14c873","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"841f28b6beffb497d8788a462fb5af822bdd4d3e57168ac2d2b58e99d2e439d8","logical_entry_identity":"6029836f0cad4112818b1c803f466252c6be07fc539c1fe3b6b5417845b68181","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Your level of skill was not enough to understand the workings of this trap.","source_tag":"_t","target":"你的技能等级太低，无法理解这个陷阱的构造。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"8b58d1c8998c1ffeba45a0f05fb030981c62feee0f4af7632f86828d9eb7117f","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"84228c34210bd530c0dd3ffefe3e49965f5593c4d7341158d8d169e2a0b4a004","logical_entry_identity":"42e5093350fe43211515625693aee38ce50b3295d759361a1d27bc36468c3da7","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"New Race: #LIGHT_GREEN#Ghoul (Undead)","source_tag":"_t","target":"新种族：#LIGHT_GREEN#食尸鬼（不死亡灵）"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"d666a24794225148f58ca965a827ac186813a71c801c8ecc83236503c494a792","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"842c2cb4531643a0ac8acf0ae3ddaed4afc9adb2e6860c2238cfb1e43aa5a14e","logical_entry_identity":"28514e4365d9a9d5290fad250f90916e9397b9af63baf7b1980baabbaf1f273b","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Weisman,\n\nThe tentacles. I still remember them. They have lashed into my mind as they lashed into my flesh. How can nature abide such a... a... being in her realm? What dark plane of existence could it have been born from? How can creation itself tolerate such an aberration?!\n\nHow did we survive? I have no clue. All I can remember is pain, and panic, and fear. All I could think of was getting away, fleeing... to my shame, all other thoughts left me. Thoughts of you, home, the world... all I could do was keep hacking away at the... things between myself and freedom. Perhaps that is why it didn't... no. I shall not think on it. The beast is certain to fill my nightmares tonight, I won't allow it to fill my waking thoughts.\n\nRest easy, brother. It may have taken your eye, but think of what else it could have taken. Anyway, I shall be leaving for the tavern soon. Maybe I can drown the images of that monster in a sea of ale.\n\nMake sure you write the words on your next letter nice and big,\nRolf","source_tag":"_t","target":"威斯曼，\n\n该死的触须，我仍然记得他们。他们插入我血肉的同时也侵入了我的思维。大自然怎能忍受这样的……怪物……存在于自己的领域？这可怕的生物究竟来自何等黑暗的位面？造物主本身是如何忍受这样恐怖存在的？！\n\n我完全不记得我们是如何幸存下来的。残存的记忆里只有痛苦、惊慌与恐惧。依稀记得当时大脑里唯一的念头就是我必须立刻逃走，远离这个鬼地方……惭愧的是，当时其它所有的想法都离我而去。\n\n对于你的牵挂，对于家的怀念，对于世界的眷恋，都已经被我抛诸脑后，唯一萦绕在脑子里的想法就是向着自由策马狂奔，离这个怪物越远越好。\n\n也许这就是为什么它没有……不！也许我不应该再想它了。既然这野兽一定会在我今晚的噩梦中出现，至少清醒时我不能允许它再充斥我的大脑。\n\n好好休息吧，兄弟，它虽然夺走了你的眼睛，但想想最坏的情况下它本会夺走……不管怎么说，我马上都要前往客栈了，希望麦芽酒能让我从恐惧中缓解出来。\n\n希望你下封信上的字又大又美，\n罗尔夫"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"63c7b1304b23e8bcdf6d6efb306d8db76bc4b7cd9f4ee3f525c5bbb2167d86fb","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"8437bed09f2dab59f57683a6f375ced0582ce0766567f8c7bdb843c983c3fe28","logical_entry_identity":"e4472661d3c2dfd3c41929a78625584c2946e516dc6a10b3ab058aaeb0ba117d","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"DESTROY!","source_tag":"_t","target":"毁灭一切！"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"7907cfb67e53a79569e83c15657cc30ecf9647859e14512a5c9eb05e1971786c","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"843863dfc7033ee8c7ab8ca3532c5e24e664006b0042ebe79624531c0033922b","logical_entry_identity":"18bc8aae3541de7382106e1380bd676de766b6f515431e7003392f7dd511bb4d","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Apply the selected cosmetics to %s?","source_tag":"tformat","target":"将所选的外观应用到%s身上？"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"98b0e4536bf387df79e92b47c6c674933b368e89cd160d1a59d7735cd3d3f5f8","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"8439035871d0f3967ed511333ad770fcce366d3da7d132037900bffd9fbcea07","logical_entry_identity":"d08fecf0819b83ff42a3e072260e3647cb48aaf45eb5a2578711c13a64e4806e","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Astonishing! I have heard tell of this Orb in ancient texts and legends. Might I see it?","source_tag":"_t","target":"真令人惊讶！我在古代的文献和传说中读到过关于多元水晶球的资料。能让我看看么？"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"4787dc1caf09e3a5e354b63da8c180c16b5bc157b1d1f043559d798467ad2135","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"843b3ad51dbe4c9806e4e7adb3f0e4d0fa3b53ce45a202f16a659638ed6676d2","logical_entry_identity":"61e354e7a6dbaced7c8b68d89cfd5affcf6643ac99edca4a984c28d364093045","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"terror","source_tag":"damage type","target":"恐惧"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"79177eee01b0113f4cb2a9b431a5393a1c8f6a6dbb30e8a56161687abddf1727","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"843ca2a6d497a97c67b1b7608e15d760d4a76e762961200ec2ae2f3783482ba2","logical_entry_identity":"39cc60e56b7e1948e44cb8c4f0a3028e4c241a4a5f86f725052d7aac14217324","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"The noxious fumes have invaded all your body, you suddenty fall into a deep slumber...\n... you feel weak ...\n... you feel unimportant ...\n... you feel like ... food ...\nYou feel like running away!","source_tag":"_t","target":"有毒的气息渗入你的全身，你突然陷入沉眠之中…\n…你感觉自己很虚弱…\n…你感觉